ACE(n^2)\n\nProof: Write u \u2192^b v if there's a ladder from u to v of length \u2264 b.\nHere's a recursive procedure to solve the bounded DFA ladder problem:"]}, "id": "BB_2", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.39093041438593, "y": 38.15830279416967, "width": 25.61078967943707, "height": 39.80633088874397, "rotation": 0}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.39093041438593, "y": 38.15830279416967, "width": 25.61078967943707, "height": 39.80633088874397, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["image"]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.39093041438593, "y": 38.15830279416967, "width": 25.61078967943707, "height": 39.80633088874397, "rotation": 0, "text": [""]}, "id": "BB_3", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "prediction-changed"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.345582486317435, "y": 31.3401706116423, "width": 69.74198592650507, "height": 43.329940901804385, "rotation": 0}, "id": "g2NHpV6DjV", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.345582486317435, "y": 31.3401706116423, "width": 69.74198592650507, "height": 43.329940901804385, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "g2NHpV6DjV", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.345582486317435, "y": 31.3401706116423, "width": 69.74198592650507, "height": 43.329940901804385, "rotation": 0, "text": ["BOUNDED-LADDER_DFA = {(B, u, v, b) | B a DFA and u \u2192^b v by a ladder in L(B)}\n\nB-L = \"On input (B, u, v, b) Let m = |u| = |v|.\n1. For b = 1, accept if u, v \u2208 L(B) and differ in \u2264 1 place, else reject.\n2. For b > 1, repeat for each w \u2208 L(B) of length |u|\n3. Recursively test u \u2192^(b/2) w and w \u2192^(b/2) v [division rounds up]\n4. Accept both accept.\n5. Reject [if all fail].\"\n\nTest (B, u, v) \u2208 LADDER_DFA with B-L procedure on input (B, u, v, t) for t = |\u03a3|^m"]}, "id": "g2NHpV6DjV", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.111024237685692, "y": 75.78830353671907, "width": 13.760750586395622, "height": 4.752316098907585, "rotation": 0}, "id": "nDREqyt05b", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.111024237685692, "y": 75.78830353671907, "width": 13.760750586395622, "height": 4.752316098907585, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["text"]}, "id": "nDREqyt05b", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.111024237685692, "y": 75.78830353671907, "width": 13.760750586395622, "height": 4.752316098907585, "rotation": 0, "text": ["Space analysis:"]}, "id": "nDREqyt05b", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 50.195465207193, "y": 79.42242761235428, "width": 40.89132134480073, "height": 13.697852285086181, "rotation": 0}, "id": "oq3urlLBYu", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640